es","\u002Fen\u002Freleases","en\u002F5.releases",[273],{"title":274,"icon":12,"path":275,"stem":276,"children":277,"page":12},"Versions","\u002Fen\u002Freleases\u002Fversions","en\u002F5.releases\u002F1.versions",[278,282,286],{"title":279,"path":280,"stem":281},"v3.2.0","\u002Fen\u002Freleases\u002Fversions\u002Fv3-2-0","en\u002F5.releases\u002F1.versions\u002F1.v3-2-0",{"title":283,"path":284,"stem":285},"v3.1.0","\u002Fen\u002Freleases\u002Fversions\u002Fv3-1-0","en\u002F5.releases\u002F1.versions\u002F2.v3-1-0",{"title":287,"path":288,"stem":289},"v3.0.0","\u002Fen\u002Freleases\u002Fversions\u002Fv3-0-0","en\u002F5.releases\u002F1.versions\u002F3.v3-0-0",{"id":291,"title":87,"body":292,"description":642,"extension":643,"links":644,"meta":645,"navigation":646,"path":88,"seo":647,"stem":89,"__hash__":648},"docs_en\u002Fen\u002F1.getting-started\u002F5.agents\u002F2.skills.md",{"type":293,"value":294,"toc":632},"minimark",[295,300,304,312,316,319,361,370,378,383,394,422,429,467,470,488,491,507,516,520,525,528,536,540,549,557,561,573,576,594,598,601,628],[296,297,299],"h2",{"id":298},"what-are-skills","What are Skills?",[301,302,303],"p",{},"Skills are structured knowledge files that give AI coding agents context about a library, framework, or codebase. The agent loads a skill directly into its context and can refer to it throughout the conversation.",[301,305,306,307,311],{},"Shuo UI provides a ",[308,309,310],"strong",{},"usage skill"," that teaches AI agents to build forms and query pages with Shuo UI.",[296,313,315],{"id":314},"usage","Usage",[301,317,318],{},"The usage skill gives AI agents comprehensive knowledge about building with Shuo UI. It covers:",[320,321,322,326,329,345,348,351,358],"ul",{},[323,324,325],"li",{},"Installation and CSS setup",[323,327,328],{},"The v-model types, main props, slots and common pitfalls of all 17 components",[323,330,331,332,336,337,340,341,344],{},"Form validation with ",[333,334,335],"code",{},"UForm",", ",[333,338,339],{},"UFormField"," and Valibot, and the shared rules (",[333,342,343],{},"requiredText"," and others)",[323,346,347],{},"The empty-value contract of each component and how to initialize state",[323,349,350],{},"The query card with a result list and server-side pagination",[323,352,353,354,357],{},"The ",[333,355,356],{},"shuoUi"," module options: site-wide defaults, locales and messages, theming",[323,359,360],{},"Display utilities for dates, numbers, phones and months",[301,362,363,364,369],{},"The skill includes additional references that the AI agent loads on demand based on the task, keeping responses focused and context-efficient. When it needs a full props table or more examples, the skill points the agent to the ",[365,366,368],"a",{"href":367},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fagents\u002Fllms-txt#markdown-version-of-a-single-page","markdown version"," of the matching docs page.",[371,372,373,374,377],"note",{},"Once installed, you can invoke the skill by typing ",[333,375,376],{},"\u002Fshuo-ui"," in your agent's chat.",[379,380,382],"h3",{"id":381},"skills-cli","Skills CLI",[301,384,353,385,393],{},[365,386,390],{"href":387,"rel":388},"https:\u002F\u002Fskills.sh",[389],"nofollow",[333,391,392],{},"skills"," CLI is the easiest way to install the Shuo UI skill. It supports many agents, including Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Windsurf and Cline.",[395,396,401],"pre",{"className":397,"code":398,"language":399,"meta":400,"style":400},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","npx skills add k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n","bash","",[333,402,403],{"__ignoreMap":400},[404,405,408,412,416,419],"span",{"class":406,"line":407},"line",1,[404,409,411],{"class":410},"sBMFI","npx",[404,413,415],{"class":414},"sfazB"," skills",[404,417,418],{"class":414}," add",[404,420,421],{"class":414}," k90325248\u002Fshuo-ui\n",[301,423,424,425,428],{},"Target specific agents with the ",[333,426,427],{},"--agent"," flag:",[395,430,432],{"cla